WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV v3.0 — ai-reads-human (15s) Narrator Sean

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.464
First, computers often swap data in text formats written for human eyes,

2
00:00:04.464 --> 00:00:06.634
forcing machines to spend extra work.

3
00:00:06.994 --> 00:00:10.707
Second, reading indented configuration text took over two thousand

4
00:00:10.707 --> 00:00:14.082
times more chip energy than reading compact machine numbers.

5
00:00:14.442 --> 00:00:17.995
Third, chopping structured text into AI word pieces burned

6
00:00:17.995 --> 00:00:21.303
twelve times more energy than parsing the text itself.
